{"chapter": "schemes", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "01L1", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{categories-definition-mono-epi}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-monomorphism}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:afbd2809bf8268e3651fa719ad03378c670d6e152e25234fab131508f7b92fba", "source_text": "A morphism of schemes is called a <TEXTITOPEN_0001>monomorphism<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> if it is\na monomorphism in the category of schemes, see\nCategories, Definition <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3c6c555a8dee620d95629e591411c0746be182cc711c1205e7dc2b5c8e107122", "unit_id": "tag:01L2:statement"}
{"chapter": "schemes", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01L1", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\begin{slogan}\nA scheme morphism is a monomorphism iff its diagonal is an isomorphism.\n\\end{slogan}", "MATH_0001": "$j : X \\to Y$", "MATH_0002": "$j$", "MATH_0003": "$\\Delta_{X/Y} : X \\to X \\times_Y X$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-monomorphism}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:b815e72e3868457c725469cb97ff7adb7a3e3816f8d5b5ed04342d4e452a1a67", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:70384284ae7b64b7dbfdee5e630cc8c40aa1a69dff44574c449129187ee6e0bd", "source_text": "<LOCKED_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes.\nThen <MATH_0002> is a monomorphism if and only if the\ndiagonal morphism <MATH_0003> is\nan isomorphism.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b4387488a3efe2d3e7c279c059dd46a5d515d55499dfae5cace01f3c973e62c8", "unit_id": "tag:01L3:statement"}
{"chapter": "schemes", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01L1", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:88d01fa0894b50798606394461ff4e70338f8b44bfee706d4e34ef90b9815747", "source_text": "This is true in any category with fibre products.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:bb40b39cb89a048c63c2f4222235693685a0baa8b5d8c02a77c1cdba851d2a0c", "unit_id": "tag:01L3:proof"}
{"chapter": "schemes", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01L1", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-monomorphism-separated}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:fd650523af261de678cd2810d015dce7e44dc1d91b313378e41113d9149d7611", "source_text": "A monomorphism of schemes is separated.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:430f4e09873dfaa65a8db976530a250d766355883439b4b290ba1a144c89d7d0", "unit_id": "tag:01L4:statement"}
{"chapter": "schemes", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01L1", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-monomorphism}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f61b253bc3e29ee4fbd877e4c17688a0f67c644b1839068f8fa4375dd1f92e44", "source_text": "This is true because an isomorphism is a closed immersion,\nand Lemma <REF_0001> above.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:512a58fe9331e6c9ec80fc0e910667a34cc559eda79a0addd9fd3d960254cd9e", "unit_id": "tag:01L4:proof"}
{"chapter": "schemes", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01L1", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-composition-monomorphism}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:9610bd085a3260fb0d8c8ff54803cc822e353cbdb131eaeba7a2eb2a97b1fe2d", "source_text": "A composition of monomorphisms is a monomorphism.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:fc2d9b90d40afb899acbc38095627bdee0738275df033c611a4b80d3cc9ce849", "unit_id": "tag:01L5:statement"}
